cli.cmd.plugins.detail:
Installs bundles in the Agent Plugins 1.0 format: a directory containing plugin.json,
optionally with skills/ and mcp.json (MCP server declarations). install accepts a local directory or .zip;
each installed bundle gets its own settings card marked "external". Plugins register at startup, so changes need a restart.
track binds an HTTPS signed manifest and Ed25519 public key, check only verifies and checks, and update stages the confirmed update;
the staged update is applied on the next service start. MCP updates do not reconnect automatically: refresh manually and restart again.
